<title>USA: AT&amp;T first quarter results due on Monday.</title>
<headline>AT&amp;T first quarter results due on Monday.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>AT&amp;T Corp said its first quarter results now look to come out on Monday April 21, not Thursday April 17 as had previously been expected.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman said there was no significance in the move beyond organizational reasons.</p>
<p>First Call's consensus of analysts forecasts for AT&amp;T in the quarter is earnings per share of $0.69 compared with $0.90 a year ago. ((-- New York Newsroom 212 859 1610))</p>
